# M16: the file dialog on the text screen. Open lists `..`, the folders and the files with their sizes and dates; the list sorts by each
# column, steps through a letter's entries, goes up with Backspace, reads the folder again with F5, opens a folder with Enter, picks a place
# and takes a file by its name.
@dialog
@cwd C:\DOCS
@dir DOCS\LETTERS\OLD
@dir DOCS\2025
@dir GAMES
@copy letter.qld DOCS\
@copy letter.rtf DOCS\
@copy plain.qld DOCS\
@copy pic.bmp DOCS\
@copy wide.rtf DOCS\
@copy heading.rtf DOCS\
@copy lists.rtf DOCS\LETTERS\
@stamp DOCS\LETTER.QLD 2026-11-24 18:45
@stamp DOCS\LETTER.RTF 2026-11-02 09:05
@stamp DOCS\PLAIN.QLD 2026-03-14 12:00
@stamp DOCS\PIC.BMP 2025-10-01 08:30
@stamp DOCS\WIDE.RTF 2026-05-02 14:30
@stamp DOCS\HEADING.RTF 2024-01-01 00:00
@place Samples C:\GAMES
f10 down enter                # File > Open...
altt end                      # All Files
altl down down down           # the list: 2025, LETTERS, then the first file; its name goes in the field
alt2 alt2                     # sort by size, then largest first
alt3                          # by date
alt1                          # by name again
l                             # type-ahead: LETTERS ...
l                             # ... and the next entry that starts with L
@wait 10
p                             # a new prefix after ten ticks: PIC.BMP
home enter                    # `..` goes up to the root, with DOCS selected
f5                            # reads it again
enter                         # into DOCS
altp end enter                # the Samples place: C:\GAMES
altu                          # the Up button: C:\
altp home enter               # the C: place: its own folder, C:\DOCS
altn p l a i n period q l d enter   # opens PLAIN.QLD
